WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Draw a line on the front guide; mirror creates the reflected stroke.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.900
Place an editable ellipse on the same guide.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.200
Orbit to inspect the mirrored line and ellipse.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Synthetic replay uses no pressure data.
